  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17; (formerly Env-Hw 104.15, renumbered by #13405) (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) (formerly Env-Hw 104.16)",
